--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SURFACE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
withAiFeature is the web AI-Off Contract higher-order component (ADR-015): a visibility gate that
renders an inner AI surface ONLY when the gated feature is enabled end-to-end (useAiEnabled), throws
at the wrapping call for an unknown feature id, and otherwise renders null so no AI surface leaks
while AI is off. It is ANONYMOUS: the web source has no titles, labels, i18n keys, charts, maps,
data hooks beyond useAiEnabled, and NO loading/empty/error/stale/offline branches — only the two
states enabled (render inner inside a data-ai-feature / data-testid marker wrapper) and disabled
(render nothing). The native port reproduces exactly those two branches; fabricating loading/error/
stale/offline chrome the web source lacks would be parity drift, so (per the VisuallyHidden /
AnnouncerRegion anonymous-surface precedent) none was invented. Evidence in the doc-comments.

Native decomposition (flat TeslaSync.App.SharedSurfaces namespace; reuses the shared IAiFeatureGate):
  - withAiFeature.Model.cs     WithAiFeatureRegistration (Slug "withAiFeature", RootAutomationId
                               "ai-feature-<id>-root" = web meta.uiTestIds[0], IsRegisteredFeature
                               registry guard, UnknownFeatureMessage) + WithAiFeatureDiagnostics.
  - withAiFeature.Source.cs    AiEnabledEvaluator — native port of useAiEnabled (registry membership
                               AND IAiFeatureGate.IsEnabled; fail-closed on null gate / blank id /
                               unknown id). Reuses the shared gate (no redeclare).
  - withAiFeature.ViewModel.cs WithAiFeatureViewModel — throws on unknown/blank id at construction
                               (web throw-at-wrapping), live IsGateOpen, RootAutomationId, WrapperName
                               (= web displayName "withAiFeature(<id>, <inner>)"), Refresh().
  - withAiFeature.cs           WithAiFeature : ContentControl — transparent marker host; gate-open ->
                               Visible + AutomationId marker + inner content; gate-closed -> Collapsed
                               + null content + no marker (web returns null). Wrap(...) factory mirrors
                               the HOC call. Emits view.opened once on Loaded. Group automation peer
                               (nameless, transparent — web bare <div> has no role).

